    {
      "id": "JuZ2PXSwUHGFqrjyYMUqD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 911.6666652134486,
      "y": 11868.698444669208,
      "width": 201.27999877929688,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bUr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 448993095,
      "version": 249,
      "versionNonce": 1256022313,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770622776818,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "结合了逻辑地址\n与虚拟线性地址\n结合了绝对编址和\n相对编址。\n大家可以理解成从\n0 开始每一个都是偏移\n多少也可以直接理解成\n地址",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "结合了逻辑地址\n与虚拟线性地址\n结合了绝对编址和\n相对编址。\n大家可以理解成从\n0 开始每一个都是偏移\n多少也可以直接理解成\n地址",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ipeW7d20-gG4gXFtdyIkT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 363.6932765415736,
      "y": 12217.031788175067,
      "width": 769.280029296875,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bUs",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1043236745,
      "version": 390,
      "versionNonce": 1249034025,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770622841019,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在平坦模式中，从 0 开始连续排布，每个地址既是相对于空间起始点的偏移，也是可以\n直接使用的绝对地址。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在平坦模式中，从 0 开始连续排布，每个地址既是相对于空间起始点的偏移，也是可以直接使用的绝对地址。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
